# Runtime data, snapshots, backups, and logs.
#
# These paths may contain live operator data, customer/pipeline data, local
# runtime state, generated agent messages, and backup archives. They should not
# be introduced to a public or shared GitHub remote. Some files are still
# tracked from legacy local history; sanitize or rebuild a clean repo before the
# first push.
data/*
data-dev/*
!data/README.md
!data-dev/README.md

